dates rust_time_function_renamed v1
description "The same file as ../rust_time_function.cal, with the alias the note of its W001 gives; check says nothing, and every target takes it. Its own alias differs from the other file's only so that the two go through the targets side by side"
use calendar "../../fixtures/calendars/weekends.cal"

inputs
  ordered : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31

date cutoff_(cutoff) = ordered
  roll following
  at 17:00
